#. Description of the plugin
#: zirkel-iban-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Accept reconciled bank transfer payments in WooCommerce via Stripe. Each order gets unique virtual bank account details (SEPA/ACH/Bacs/SPEI), and webhooks mark the order paid automatically."
msgstr ""

